    {
      "id": "37ca1404-f6dd-4b8e-9238-380a8602d8f7",
      "name": "Credit Account Disputes",
      "description": {
        "content": "// Conditional snippet for beta or internal content\ninclude::../../maturity-admonition-banner.adoc[]\n\nUse the credit account disputes endpoints to create and manage disputes on a <</core-api/credit-accounts, credit account>>.\n\nFor more on disputes, see <</developer-guides/about-credit-account-disputes, About Credit Account Disputes>>.\n\nCreating a dispute triggers the creation of a <</core-api/credit-account-journal-entries, journal entry>> belonging to the `DISPUTE` group.\nFor more on dispute journal entries, see <</developer-guides/about-credit-account-journal-entries#_disputes, Disputes>> in the About Credit Account Journal Entries guide.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
